🚀 .gitignore File Push Karne Ke CMD Steps
Agar tumne .gitignore file banayi hai (ya update ki hai) aur usko GitHub pe push karna hai, to ye steps follow karo.

✅ STEP 1: Project Root Mein Jao
cmd
cd Desktop\ai-autonomous-scientific-laboratory
Path tumhare hisaab se change karo agar kahin aur rakha hai.

✅ STEP 2: Check Karo .gitignore File Hai Ya Nahi
cmd
dir .gitignore
Output aana chahiye:

text
.gitignore
Agar File Not Found aaye to pehle file banao:

cmd
type nul > .gitignore
Phir .gitignore open karke content paste karo (jo maine pichhle message mein diya tha).

✅ STEP 3: Check Git Status
cmd
git status
Tumhe .gitignore untracked files mein dikhna chahiye:

text
Untracked files:
        .gitignore
✅ STEP 4: .gitignore Ko Staging Mein Add Karo
cmd
git add .gitignore
✅ STEP 5: Verify Karo Ki Add Hua
cmd
git status
Ab .gitignore green mein dikhna chahiye (staged):

text
Changes to be committed:
        new file:   .gitignore
✅ STEP 6: Commit Karo
cmd
git commit -m "Add .gitignore file"
Output:

text
[main abc1234] Add .gitignore file
 1 file changed, XX insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .gitignore
✅ STEP 7: GitHub Pe Push Karo
cmd
git push
Ya agar pehli baar push kar rahi ho:

cmd
git push -u origin main
Output:

text
Enumerating objects: X, done.
Writing objects: 100% ...
To https://github.com/vishakha2121/ai-autonomous-scientific-laboratory.git
   abc1234..def5678  main -> main
✅ STEP 8: Verify Karo GitHub Pe
Browser kholo:

text
https://github.com/vishakha2121/ai-autonomous-scientific-laboratory
.gitignore file repo mein dikhni chahiye. ✅

🔄 Agar .gitignore Update Karna Ho Baad Mein
cmd
git add .gitignore
git commit -m "Update .gitignore"
git push
⚠️ Agar Galti Se .env Ya node_modules Pehle Push Ho Gaya Ho
Agar tumne .gitignore banane se pehle hi .env ya node_modules push kar diya tha, to sirf .gitignore add karne se wo remove nahi hoga. Iske liye ye karo:

🔧 .env Ko Remove Karo (Git se, computer se nahi)
cmd
git rm --cached backend/.env
git commit -m "Remove .env from tracking"
git push
🔧 node_modules Ko Remove Karo
cmd
git rm -r --cached frontend/node_modules
git commit -m "Remove node_modules from tracking"
git push
🔧 __pycache__ Ko Remove Karo
cmd
git rm -r --cached backend/app/__pycache__
git commit -m "Remove __pycache__ from tracking"
git push
🔧 Saari Cached Files Ek Saath Remove Karo (Nuclear Option)
Agar bahut kuch galat push ho gaya hai:

cmd
git rm -r --cached .
git add .
git commit -m "Apply .gitignore properly"
git push
Note: Ye tumhari local files ko delete nahi karega — sirf Git tracking se hataega. Fir .gitignore ke hisaab se dobara add hoga.

